GRANT (COMMUNITY):
You may install and use this Community edition free of charge for personal use.
Commercial use requires Atelier or Team.

Community is a rectangular border with outer and inner corner radii (including
sharp miters), single on-axis rotation (9 pivot axes), the free materials
(gold, silver, aluminium, bronze, brass, rustic oak, and glossy red plastic),
automatic light, and one simple profile. Look, Atelier, and Team are not
included. They require a separate paid license. Installing Community does not
grant those tiers.

Support is not included with Community. Support is granted only for Look,
Atelier, and Team.

